From 375c597c7139ebcc18a04dff23379891cf913b99 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: juansolo457 <5344231+Juansolo457@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 18:28:34 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 7/8] Settings: help line under the Game Options list

A panel below the list says what the highlighted option does. Each row's hover
window sets it on enter (mouse or controller focus) and restores the default
hint on exit. 85 strings (#str_231309-231393), English in every openQ4 table.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
